*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0011
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-02-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 971
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0011.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCOUNT-TYPE       PIC X.
       88 ACCOUNT-BUSINESS VALUE 'B'.
    *> TRANSACTIONS THIS MONTH
    05 TXN-COUNT-MTH      PIC 9(3).
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHARGE-EXCESS
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
CHARGE-EXCESS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2001
    *>  IF TXN-COUNT-MTH > 20
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF TXN-COUNT-MTH > 25
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE ROUNDED = (TXN-COUNT-MTH - 25) * 0.25
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCOUNT-BUSINESS AND TXN-COUNT-MTH > 55
        ADD 10 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
